# What `deploy/Dockerfile` may never see. The build context is the repository root
# (see deploy/compose.yaml), so this file is what keeps a local checkout's state —
# dependencies, builds, databases, editor droppings — out of the image and out of the
# build cache key.
.git
var
**/var
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
frontend/coverage
backend/src/carnet.egg-info
